    "description": "Over here! Novel fans.\ud83d\ude0e\r\nWelcome to NovelOasis! A platform full of fantistic novels.\r\nNovelOasis is a newly launched novel APP with a huge number of novels. With it, you can build a library of your own in a small phone!\r\n\u3010Why NovelOasis?\ud83e\uddd0\u3011\r\n\ud83e\udd17Countless amazing stories, plus daily recommendations customized for you!\r\n\ud83e\udd17Hot books updated daily!\r\n\ud83e\udd17New books updated weekly!\r\n\ud83e\udd17Personal library auto sync on every device!\r\n\ud83e\udd17Perfect night mode to give you better reading experience during the night!\r\n\r\n\u3010Other Features\ud83c\udf88\u3011\r\n\u2728Auto-Read: Auto-Read liberates your hands\r\n\u2728Different fonts: many fonts for you to choose\r\n\u2728Special events: different events every month\r\n\u2728Fast-responding CS team: any of your questions will get answered within 24h\r\n\r\nRomance, Billionaires, Werewolf, Fantsay, Urban, etc...\r\nPlenty of wonderful novels are waiting for you!\r\nStop hesitating! Start your adventure with us RIGHT NOW!\ud83c\udf89",
